        "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 320 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><text x='160' y='40' font-size='14' fill='var(--ink)' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>buzda kayan disk: Fnet ≈ 0</text><line x1='10' y1='128' x2='310' y2='128' stroke='var(--c1)' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><ellipse cx='40' cy='120' rx='14' ry='6' fill='var(--c5)' fill-opacity='0.3'/><line x1='30' y1='100' x2='53' y2='100' stroke='var(--c3)' stroke-width='2.5' fill='none'/><polygon points='60,100 50,104.5 50,95.5' fill='var(--c3)'/><text x='40' y='150' font-size='12' fill='var(--ink)' text-anchor='middle'>0 s</text><ellipse cx='100' cy='120' rx='14' ry='6' fill='var(--c5)' fill-opacity='0.44999999999999996'/><line x1='90' y1='100' x2='113' y2='100' stroke='var(--c3)' stroke-width='2.5' fill='none'/><polygon points='120,100 110,104.5 110,95.5' fill='var(--c3)'/><text x='100' y='150' font-size='12' fill='var(--ink)' text-anchor='middle'>1 s</text><ellipse cx='160' cy='120' rx='14' ry='6' fill='var(--c5)' fill-opacity='0.6'/><line x1='150' y1='100' x2='173' y2='100' stroke='var(--c3)' stroke-width='2.5' fill='none'/><polygon points='180,100 170,104.5 170,95.5' fill='var(--c3)'/><text x='160' y='150' font-size='12' fill='var(--ink)' text-anchor='middle'>2 s</text><ellipse cx='220' cy='120' rx='14' ry='6' fill='var(--c5)' fill-opacity='0.75'/><line x1='210' y1='100' x2='233' y2='100' stroke='var(--c3)' stroke-width='2.5' fill='none'/><polygon points='240,100 230,104.5 230,95.5' fill='var(--c3)'/><text x='220' y='150' font-size='12' fill='var(--ink)' text-anchor='middle'>3 s</text><ellipse cx='280' cy='120' rx='14' ry='6' fill='var(--c5)' fill-opacity='0.8999999999999999'/><line x1='270' y1='100' x2='293' y2='100' stroke='var(--c3)' stroke-width='2.5' fill='none'/><polygon points='300,100 290,104.5 290,95.5' fill='var(--c3)'/><text x='280' y='150' font-size='12' fill='var(--ink)' text-anchor='middle'>4 s</text><text x='160' y='180' font-size='12' fill='var(--muted)' text-anchor='middle'>eşit sürede eşit yol → sabit hız</text></svg>",
